### Future Derived Objectives

Future perception objectives shall maintain direct traceability to SO-F-002.

Examples include:

- Acquire Environmental Information
- Observe Vehicle State
- Observe Human State
- Detect Environmental Changes
- Maintain Situational Observation
- Assess Observation Quality

---

### Derived Engineering Artifacts

Successful realization of this objective is expected to contribute to:

- Functional Requirements
- Perception Architecture
- Sensor Abstraction Architecture
- Observation Models
- Verification Procedures
- Validation Procedures

---

### Traceability Notes

All engineering artifacts implementing environmental perception shall maintain traceability to SO-F-002, either directly or through approved child objectives.

Likewise, any future refinement of perception capabilities shall preserve traceability back to SO-F-001 through SO-F-002.
